{"id":"603289","name":"豆角蛋炒饭","author":"尔东叶","authorId":"6100832","desc":"","cover":"images/603289/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆角","amount":"150g"},{"name":"米饭","amount":"100g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米粒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆角、香菇、胡萝卜洗干净切碎。备好玉米粒。","img":"images/603289/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"起油锅，鸡蛋炒熟盛出。","img":"images/603289/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起油锅，葱姜入锅煸香后豆角入锅炒。","img":"images/603289/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加蚝油炒均匀，加适量水，盖上锅盖烧一会儿。","img":"images/603289/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜入锅炒。","img":"images/603289/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"玉米粒入锅炒。","img":"images/603289/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"香菇入锅炒，加盐炒均匀。","img":"images/603289/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"米饭入锅炒。","img":"images/603289/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"鸡蛋入锅炒均匀关火。","img":"images/603289/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盛出享用。","img":"images/603289/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"1、食材搭配依据个人偏爱。\n2、豆角不容易熟，要多烧一会儿。\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}